519
00:18:06,360 --> 00:18:07,680
First, look at the medical evidence

520
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:09,080
to avoid subjective presumption.

521
00:18:09,080 --> 00:18:09,960
Simply put,

522
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:12,240
