526
00:18:17,480 --> 00:18:17,680
Then...

527
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:18,880
What about the second point?

528
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:21,200
Second, judge the degree of intent

529
00:18:21,360 --> 00:18:22,480
