535
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:30,800
I get it.

536
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:32,440
Cheng Jia searched for this.

537
00:18:32,440 --> 00:18:33,000
The search history

538
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:33,800
