539
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:35,760
And the third is

540
00:18:36,040 --> 00:18:39,360
the weight ratio between underlying
diseases and intervening factors.

541
00:18:39,360 --> 00:18:40,160
You can understand it as

542
00:18:40,160 --> 00:18:43,420
